{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0777","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"perimeter_three_wire_laps","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah padang berbentuk segi empat tepat berukuran 18 m × 12 m hendak dikelilingi dengan tiga lapis dawai. Berapakah jumlah panjang dawai yang diperlukan?","options":["180 m","60 m","90 m","120 m"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter padang = 2(18 + 12) = 60 m.","Tiga lapis dawai = 3 × 60 = 180 m."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0778","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"composite_area_corner_cut","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sekeping kad berbentuk segi empat tepat berukuran 14 cm × 9 cm. Sebuah petak 5 cm × 4 cm dipotong dari satu penjuru. Berapakah luas kad yang tinggal?","options":["20 cm²","106 cm²","116 cm²","126 cm²"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Luas asal = 14 × 9 = 126 cm².","Luas dipotong = 5 × 4 = 20 cm².","Baki = 126 - 20 = 106 cm²."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0779","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"cuboid_percentage_volume","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah bekas kuboid berukuran 10 cm × 8 cm × 6 cm diisi air sehingga 75% daripada kapasiti penuhnya. Berapakah isi padu air di dalam bekas?","options":["120 cm³","240 cm³","360 cm³","480 cm³"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Kapasiti penuh = 10 × 8 × 6 = 480 cm³.","75% × 480 = 360 cm³."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0780","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"elapsed_time_two_activities_break","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Program bermula pada pukul 9:35 pagi. Aktiviti pertama berlangsung 1 jam 25 minit, diikuti rehat 15 minit dan aktiviti kedua 50 minit. Pada pukul berapakah program tamat?","options":["11:50 pagi","12:00 tengah hari","12:20 tengah hari","12:05 tengah hari"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["9:35 + 1 jam 25 minit = 11:00 pagi.","11:00 + 15 minit = 11:15 pagi.","11:15 + 50 minit = 12:05 tengah hari."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0781","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"money_multi_item_change","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Tiga buku nota berharga RM4.80 setiap satu dan dua batang pen berharga RM2.35 setiap satu. Jika dibayar dengan RM20, berapakah baki wang?","options":["RM0.90","RM0.60","RM1.10","RM1.60"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Kos buku nota = 3 × RM4.80 = RM14.40.","Kos pen = 2 × RM2.35 = RM4.70.","Jumlah = RM19.10, baki = RM20.00 - RM19.10 = RM0.90."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0782","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"mean_missing_score","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Purata markah lima ujian ialah 76. Empat markah ialah 72, 81, 68 dan 79. Berapakah markah kelima?","options":["76","80","78","82"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah lima markah = 76 × 5 = 380.","Jumlah empat markah = 72 + 81 + 68 + 79 = 300.","Markah kelima = 380 - 300 = 80."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0783","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"exterior_angle_triangle","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Satu sudut luar sebuah segi tiga ialah 125°. Salah satu sudut dalam bertentangan ialah 48°. Berapakah sudut dalam bertentangan yang satu lagi?","options":["67°","73°","77°","83°"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Sudut luar = jumlah dua sudut dalam bertentangan.","125° = 48° + x.","x = 77°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-12-0784","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"coordinate_multi_move","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah robot bermula di titik (3,5). Ia bergerak 4 unit ke kanan, 2 unit ke bawah dan 1 unit ke kiri. Apakah koordinat akhirnya?","options":["(6,7)","(7,3)","(8,3)","(6,3)"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["(3,5) → kanan 4 = (7,5).","Turun 2 = (7,3).","Kiri 1 = (6,3)."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-13-0847","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"equal_perimeter_area_difference","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah segi empat tepat berukuran 10 cm × 6 cm dan sebuah segi empat sama mempunyai perimeter yang sama. Berapakah beza luas kedua-dua bentuk?","options":["4 cm²","2 cm²","8 cm²","16 cm²"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter segi empat tepat = 2(10 + 6) = 32 cm.","Sisi segi empat sama = 32 ÷ 4 = 8 cm.","Luas: 8×8 - 10×6 = 64 - 60 = 4 cm²."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-13-0848","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"fraction_of_area","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah papan berukuran 15 cm × 8 cm. Sebanyak 3/5 daripada luas papan dicat. Berapakah luas bahagian yang dicat?","options":["45 cm²","72 cm²","60 cm²","75 cm²"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Luas papan = 15 × 8 = 120 cm².","3/5 × 120 = 72 cm²."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-13-0849","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"cuboid_small_cubes","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah kotak berukuran 12 cm × 8 cm × 6 cm diisi penuh dengan kubus kecil bersisi 2 cm. Berapakah bilangan kubus kecil yang diperlukan?","options":["36","48","72","96"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu kotak = 12 × 8 × 6 = 576 cm³.","Isi padu satu kubus = 2 × 2 × 2 = 8 cm³.","576 ÷ 8 = 72 kubus."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-13-0850","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"time_cross_noon","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah bas bertolak pada pukul 11:48 pagi dan perjalanan mengambil masa 1 jam 37 minit. Pada pukul berapakah bas tiba?","options":["12:25 tengah hari","1:15 petang","1:35 petang","1:25 petang"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["11:48 pagi + 1 jam = 12:48 tengah hari.","Tambah 37 minit = 1:25 petang."]}
